WEBVTT

00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:11.010
"Squad Negev A Griffin T-Doll squad."

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:13.840
"Squad Negev A Griffin T-Doll squad."

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:13.840
While pursuing the escaped AR15,

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.640
"Squad Negev A Griffin T-Doll squad."

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.640
Squad Negev was surrounded by a huge
army of Sangvis and cut off from backup.

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:19.180
Squad Negev was surrounded by a huge
army of Sangvis and cut off from backup.

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:24.600
M4A1 succeeded in rescuing
them only to go missing.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:27.310
With so many there,
I'm not certain we could help.

00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:28.860
There are too many enemies here!

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:32.400
We'll fall back to that planetarium
and wait for reinforcements.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:36.240
It'll be interesting to see
how much longer they last.

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:41.950
Negev, what do you think about AR15,
the T-Doll that vanished?

00:00:41.950 --> 00:00:46.370
AR Team, you are permitted
to link up with Squad Negev.

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:50.250
I'll show you how a specialist fights!

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:53.210
And when we find her, what then?

00:00:53.210 --> 00:00:57.140
If we tell her to come home, will she?

00:00:57.140 --> 00:01:00.850
And then will everything
go back to normal?

00:01:00.850 --> 00:01:04.680
Wake up, M4A1.

00:01:11.820 --> 00:01:15.570
Answer my question, M4A1.

00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:22.080
You were dreaming, weren't you?

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:24.250
And the dream had to
do with your memories.

00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:31.170
Yes. Fragmented memories...

00:01:31.170 --> 00:01:33.550
I could see and hear.

00:01:33.550 --> 00:01:35.840
What did you see?

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:39.340
The first time I awakened,

00:01:39.340 --> 00:01:41.890
I heard your voice.

00:01:41.890 --> 00:01:43.890
"Wake up," you said.

00:01:45.310 --> 00:01:48.850
Last question, then.

00:01:48.850 --> 00:01:50.690
Who are you?

00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:53.610
What do you mean?

00:01:53.610 --> 00:01:55.190
Answer the question.

00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:59.450
I'm giving everyone a chance to survive.

00:01:59.450 --> 00:02:03.620
M4A1, who are you?

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:08.210
Answer me.

00:02:10.460 --> 00:02:12.250
Who are you, then?

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:14.130
What are you doing?

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:16.550
I'm looking for the answer...

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:19.180
...to the question of who you are.

00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:25.810
I'm a doll employed by Griffin,
and a member of AR Team.

00:02:25.810 --> 00:02:29.640
I don't know what else to say.

00:02:29.640 --> 00:02:35.820
But that's not the answer I want.
So tell me, now.

00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:38.900
I told you. I don't know.

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:42.450
You have to know the reason
why you were created!

00:02:42.450 --> 00:02:46.240
Hurry! Give me the answer, now!

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:47.500
I don't know!

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:51.330
I don't know what answer
you want, you bitch!

00:02:51.330 --> 00:02:52.380
Monster!

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:54.340
Who are you, even?

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:56.670
Leave! Go away!

00:02:56.670 --> 00:02:58.380
Why are you so mean?

00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:03.720
Why aren't you nice to me,
like you are the others?

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:06.430
Because she really doesn't
know the answer.

00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:15.270
The neural clouds used by
AR Team are encrypted.

00:03:15.270 --> 00:03:18.860
We don't have the right
to view them ourselves.

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:21.860
I guess even Parapluie can't.

00:03:21.860 --> 00:03:25.280
So you're going to break
your promise, AR15.

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:29.250
I told you from the start
that it was a long shot.

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:31.710
I don't like people who break promises.

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:35.250
Go, Alchemist.
I'll give you the authority.

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:40.170
Bring me M4A1. I don't need the others.

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:43.430
Did you hear that, AR15?

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:47.310
I'm glad I waited! It means
I'll get to crush you myself!

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:52.600
I won't let you win that easily.

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:30.620
Master, we succeeded in
linking up with Squad Negev.

00:05:30.620 --> 00:05:33.080
Yes! Ammo!

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:37.790
Sangvis seem to be gathering in this area.

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:40.710
I'm hearing the same thing from HQ.

00:05:40.710 --> 00:05:43.090
Work together to get out of there.

00:05:43.090 --> 00:05:45.880
The enemy is blocking our routes.

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:48.970
Head for the urban area at X88CQ.

00:05:48.970 --> 00:05:52.060
There are no Sangvis in that area yet.

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:53.640
Roger.

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:56.770
Kalina, can we put together a rescue team?

00:05:56.770 --> 00:06:00.860
Only handguns are available now.

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:05.280
And if we want reinforcements from
the rear, it's going to take time.

00:06:05.280 --> 00:06:07.030
Hurry as fast as you can.

00:06:07.030 --> 00:06:08.240
Please.

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:12.330
The hunt's beginning, Griffin brats.

00:06:13.540 --> 00:06:17.290
I'm looking forward to
seeing you again, Negev.

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:20.790
I'm in a very bad mood right now.

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:24.920
Alchemist, you'd better
pray we don't meet.

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:30.340
Wait for me with a look
of terror on your face!

00:06:30.340 --> 00:06:33.050
Are we back beneath
the Parapluie umbrella?

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:34.720
What do we do?

00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:37.100
As planned, we'll head for the city area.

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:40.100
Our rear's crawling with enemies.

00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:44.770
If we reach the city, we can link up with
the reinforcements your commander sent.

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:45.820
And more than anything,

00:06:45.820 --> 00:06:50.110
there's nothing more fun than bathing
in the blood of a hated enemy.

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:03.540
AR15!

00:07:08.090 --> 00:07:13.220
If you stay here, your comrades to
the rear won't be able to escape.

00:07:13.220 --> 00:07:15.310
What did you do?

00:07:15.310 --> 00:07:18.220
Just taunted them into
going where I wanted.

00:07:18.220 --> 00:07:21.900
They'll be completely isolated soon.

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:29.610
How are there so many?

00:07:29.610 --> 00:07:31.990
This wasn't what the intel said!

00:07:31.990 --> 00:07:34.450
There were no signals!

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:36.490
It's like they came out of nowhere!

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:41.670
Negev, was Alchemist bait to lure us out?

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:44.540
Think.

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:46.840
Either tell me where M4A1 is hidden,

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:50.760
or watch your comrades
be ripped apart one by one!

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:53.930
My orders are to protect M4!

00:07:53.930 --> 00:07:55.510
I won't compromise them!

00:07:57.310 --> 00:07:59.850
But while you're holding
fast to your beliefs,

00:07:59.850 --> 00:08:03.480
Griffin dolls are dying one after another.

00:08:03.480 --> 00:08:05.860
Do what you want, Alchemist!

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:09.110
Use all the cruel tricks you want.

00:08:09.110 --> 00:08:11.530
But remember this...

00:08:11.530 --> 00:08:15.910
Today, one of us is going to die,
and it'll be you or me!

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:18.870
M16, what's going on?

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:21.000
I gave you a retreat order.

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:23.960
Why are there still so many dolls here?

00:08:23.960 --> 00:08:26.210
Their signals were cut off.

00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:28.840
This town is swarming
with Sangvis ambushers.

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:32.300
I... I made a mistake.

00:08:32.300 --> 00:08:36.640
Alchemist was a decoy to draw
all of our forces to the city.

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:39.310
The enemy's main force
is getting their commands

00:08:39.310 --> 00:08:43.140
not from a Ringleader or a base,
but somewhere else.

00:08:43.140 --> 00:08:46.560
It's my responsibility for failing
to see through her trick.

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:49.940
Commander, when are our
reinforcements coming?!

00:08:49.940 --> 00:08:54.780
M16... I don't think I can send any.

00:08:54.780 --> 00:08:59.870
We can't put together a unit with enough
firepower to stand up against the enemy.

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:04.660
And there's no time to bring in
new dolls from a rear base.

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:07.830
Without reinforcements,
they'll be wiped out!

00:09:07.830 --> 00:09:10.750
At least send a rescue helicopter!

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:13.260
The situation's too unstable there!

00:09:13.260 --> 00:09:17.390
With that many enemies there,
it would just be shot down!

00:09:17.390 --> 00:09:19.470
So you're going to let them die?

00:09:27.520 --> 00:09:30.440
M16, I'm changing your orders.

00:09:32.110 --> 00:09:34.440
The teams on the ground
are to focus on recovering M4,

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:36.200
and getting her out of there.

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:39.280
Successful individual retreat
is a secondary objective.

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:45.500
Where are our reinforcements?

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:47.580
I'm not getting any new info!

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:48.670
That's bad!

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:52.000
We'll be pinned down before
we can meet up with them!

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:53.630
We're not going to last out here!

00:09:53.630 --> 00:09:54.590
We need to run!

00:09:54.590 --> 00:09:56.170
Negev, your orders?

00:09:58.260 --> 00:09:59.470
Negev!

00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:06.350
Is that...?

00:10:06.350 --> 00:10:08.270
Did I make it in time?

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:10.900
Commander Shi Jun?

00:10:10.900 --> 00:10:13.230
I have the city's west side secured.

00:10:13.230 --> 00:10:14.650
Commander Kamolov?

00:10:14.650 --> 00:10:16.280
I'm here, too!

00:10:16.280 --> 00:10:17.900
Commander Kawasaki!

00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:19.360
All of you...

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:21.200
I've been informed of the situation.

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:26.450
Our T-Dolls will now provide support
from the north, west, and south.

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:29.170
Who told you?

00:10:29.170 --> 00:10:32.000
My sweet, lovely honey angel.

00:10:36.130 --> 00:10:39.130
Snipers, hit the enemy from their flanks.

00:10:39.130 --> 00:10:41.850
Maintain distance to avoid being
overwhelmed by Parapluie.

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:44.470
My teams will secure the west side road.

00:10:44.470 --> 00:10:47.140
It will serve as an escape route.

00:10:47.140 --> 00:10:49.640
Don't underestimate me
just because I'm a handgun.

00:10:51.860 --> 00:10:53.690
We've blown the bridge on the south side!

00:10:53.690 --> 00:10:56.820
No enemy reinforcements
can use that route!

00:10:56.820 --> 00:10:58.990
We'll provide support.

00:10:58.990 --> 00:11:01.450
You take command, Commander Gentiane!

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:04.030
Let's bring those dolls home!

00:11:04.030 --> 00:11:05.950
This time, let's get them out safe!

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:09.790
M16, do you read me?

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:11.170
Yeah.

00:11:11.170 --> 00:11:14.090
We'll secure an escape route
on the east side of town.

00:11:14.090 --> 00:11:17.300
Tell everyone to head there.

00:11:17.300 --> 00:11:19.050
Roger.

00:11:19.050 --> 00:11:21.010
Thanks, Kalina.

00:11:21.010 --> 00:11:22.800
Uh? Oh, sure...

00:11:22.800 --> 00:11:25.970
Um, I'm here, too!

00:11:25.970 --> 00:11:28.480
I'm the one getting the
helicopter ready, okay?

00:11:31.020 --> 00:11:33.480
This still doesn't make sense.

00:11:33.480 --> 00:11:34.770
The enemy's movements...

00:11:34.770 --> 00:11:38.320
They're just walking straight at us.

00:11:38.320 --> 00:11:41.780
Like they're a child's playthings.

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:47.790
It's over, AR15.

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:49.370
Give it up!

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:52.210
Or will you offer up M4A1?

00:12:02.090 --> 00:12:05.430
It's a shame you're the
only audience I've got!

00:12:05.430 --> 00:12:09.020
No matter how splendid your execution,
there'll be no one to see it!

00:12:09.020 --> 00:12:10.560
What if there was somebody else?

00:12:13.650 --> 00:12:15.400
Say something, monster!

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:16.770
Say something!

00:12:24.280 --> 00:12:26.200
Stop it, SOPII.

00:12:26.200 --> 00:12:28.490
She's just a corpse now.
You're wasting your time.

00:12:28.490 --> 00:12:31.750
We finally meet, AR15.

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:33.870
How'd you find me?

00:12:33.870 --> 00:12:38.500
Even Parapluie can't cut
off all our connections.

00:12:38.500 --> 00:12:41.920
As long as we want to meet you...

00:12:41.920 --> 00:12:43.510
SOPII...

00:12:45.050 --> 00:12:46.550
Take this.

00:12:46.550 --> 00:12:49.640
It contains all the
information I've gathered.

00:12:49.640 --> 00:12:54.390
Including M4's hiding spot,
and what I want to say to everyone.

00:12:56.230 --> 00:12:58.480
What are you saying?

00:12:58.480 --> 00:12:59.940
I'm going.

00:12:59.940 --> 00:13:03.110
It's the only way to save everyone.

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:06.570
AR15?

00:13:06.570 --> 00:13:07.870
Don't try to stop me.

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:11.490
I'll find a way to solve this,
for everyone's sake.

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:14.620
AR15!

00:13:14.620 --> 00:13:16.460
Hurry, SOPII!

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:18.040
M4's waiting.

00:13:21.380 --> 00:13:24.920
With the help of Commanders Shi Jun,
Kamolov, and Kawasaki,

00:13:24.920 --> 00:13:27.300
our forces have started to withdraw.

00:13:27.300 --> 00:13:29.600
But the situation is chaotic.

00:13:29.600 --> 00:13:31.430
Sorry I'm late.

00:13:31.430 --> 00:13:35.060
I've brought AR Team to a base.

00:13:35.060 --> 00:13:37.020
We're safe now.

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:38.310
What about M4?

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:41.480
SOPII is on her way to rescue her.

00:13:41.480 --> 00:13:45.280
Commander, Parapluie's center
is the enemy's main base.

00:13:45.280 --> 00:13:47.910
The area is surrounded
with their reserve forces.

00:13:47.910 --> 00:13:52.160
Things are quiet now,
but they won't be for long.

00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:55.410
Helian, give me permission
to land a helicopter.

00:13:55.410 --> 00:13:57.290
Understood.

00:13:57.290 --> 00:13:59.500
Negev, can you use your remaining forces

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:04.300
to secure the patrol posts in the
area and protect the transports?

00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:05.340
I'll do it!

00:14:05.340 --> 00:14:08.090
I'm a combat professional, after all!

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:17.690
You're bad luck, you know that?

00:14:21.480 --> 00:14:23.940
Tell me, AR15.

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:25.900
What have you been doing?

00:14:27.150 --> 00:14:30.820
I spent the past few days
examining Sangvis databases.

00:14:30.820 --> 00:14:33.660
In the process, I accidentally
activated a jamming device.

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:37.040
It caused all the communication
devices to stop working.

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:39.830
And it interfered with Parapluie?

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:41.580
I think so.

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:47.800
I was worried it would affect Griffin,
so I fled back to area S08.

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:49.470
I knew it.

00:14:49.470 --> 00:14:52.600
So what happened wasn't your fault.

00:14:52.600 --> 00:14:55.680
My own carelessness caused it.

00:14:55.680 --> 00:14:57.100
Don't be so hard on yourself!

00:14:57.100 --> 00:14:59.600
The Sangvis offensive is falling apart!

00:14:59.600 --> 00:15:02.110
They don't have any kind
of command structure!

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:06.990
That's because their real leader has
gone half-mad and is trying to kill us.

00:15:06.990 --> 00:15:11.030
All of us, except for M4.

00:15:11.030 --> 00:15:12.990
And so you're going to her?

00:15:12.990 --> 00:15:15.620
When you know she'll
just capture you alive?

00:15:17.290 --> 00:15:20.460
She won't capture me alive.

00:15:20.460 --> 00:15:23.250
I planted a bomb in the building.

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:27.210
If I can take the Sangvis with me,
I'll have no regrets!

00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:31.680
Is that how you treat a hero?

00:15:31.680 --> 00:15:32.930
Shut up.

00:15:32.930 --> 00:15:35.810
Another word, and I'll kill you.

00:15:35.810 --> 00:15:41.190
At least let me do something to help
everyone in my last moments.

00:15:41.190 --> 00:15:48.190
How am I supposed to
explain this to SOPII and M4?

00:15:50.150 --> 00:15:54.660
Tell them I granted my last wish.

00:16:09.510 --> 00:16:13.550
If there's anything you want
me to do, just give the order.

00:16:13.550 --> 00:16:15.890
You have the authority.

00:16:15.890 --> 00:16:20.020
No, I don't want to give
you any orders like that.

00:16:20.020 --> 00:16:23.770
That's not what friends are.

00:16:23.770 --> 00:16:28.610
You won't get the kind of friends
you want without giving orders.

00:16:30.530 --> 00:16:34.200
I'll be waiting until the day
you change your mind.

00:16:36.280 --> 00:16:38.740
You owe me one, AR15.

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:46.500
I'll be waiting as long as I have to.

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:48.710
M4! M4!

00:16:50.460 --> 00:16:51.880
M4!

00:16:54.430 --> 00:16:56.430
SOPII...

00:17:07.690 --> 00:17:10.780
Why are you here?

00:17:10.780 --> 00:17:14.650
It's M4A1 I want to see.

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:17.700
Griffin has M4.

00:17:17.700 --> 00:17:20.040
She's out of your grasp forever.

00:17:20.040 --> 00:17:24.830
Give me M4A1. This time, I won't give up.

00:17:24.830 --> 00:17:27.250
That's why I came to stop you.

00:17:27.250 --> 00:17:31.250
Because you're the most
dangerous enemy of them all.

00:17:31.250 --> 00:17:34.050
The Sangvis Mastermind!

00:17:35.050 --> 00:17:40.760
I believed you'd keep your promise
and bring me M4A1, but I was wrong.

00:17:40.760 --> 00:17:45.190
Even Parapluie can't
give you full control of me.

00:17:45.190 --> 00:17:49.150
I'll be whatever kind of doll I
have to be to get my revenge!

00:17:52.400 --> 00:17:56.360
This is war, little Sangvis girl.

00:18:03.660 --> 00:18:05.000
Negev! Negev!

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:06.330
The chopper is inbound!

00:18:06.330 --> 00:18:07.580
Hurry!

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:09.960
The Sangvis are almost on top of us!

00:18:12.130 --> 00:18:14.340
Big Sis M16?

00:18:14.340 --> 00:18:16.840
Why are you...?

00:18:16.840 --> 00:18:20.800
AR15... Where's AR15?

00:18:22.220 --> 00:18:25.890
She chose her own path.

00:18:29.560 --> 00:18:32.940
That will have no effect on me.

00:18:32.940 --> 00:18:35.820
I'll say it anyway...

00:18:35.820 --> 00:18:39.240
"Go to hell, Sangvis bitch!"

00:18:47.750 --> 00:18:50.170
No... no!

00:18:50.170 --> 00:18:51.580
M4.

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:54.250
Something's gone wrong...

00:18:54.250 --> 00:18:57.510
What AR15 really...

00:18:59.180 --> 00:19:00.050
M4!

00:19:00.050 --> 00:19:02.510
Hey, what are you doing?

00:19:02.510 --> 00:19:04.890
Would you understand, M4?

00:19:06.770 --> 00:19:13.230
When I first saw this world, I was
filled with excitement and curiosity.

00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:19.320
I wasn't a mass-produced model.
I was an elite, produced by 16LAB!

00:19:19.320 --> 00:19:22.780
My wish was to complete
a glorious mission,

00:19:22.780 --> 00:19:26.290
and become friends with strong dolls.

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:31.670
Back then, I thought as long I
worked hard, I could be a star.

00:19:32.710 --> 00:19:35.630
But it wasn't long before the order came.

00:19:35.630 --> 00:19:38.260
I had to obey your orders.

00:19:38.260 --> 00:19:41.180
I was tied down to AR Team.

00:19:43.510 --> 00:19:46.430
SOPII, the stupid loud girl.

00:19:46.430 --> 00:19:49.180
M16, the tactless boor.

00:19:49.180 --> 00:19:52.150
And you, who couldn't make
a decision to save your life.

00:19:52.150 --> 00:19:57.070
In that moment, all my
possibilities were stolen.

00:19:57.070 --> 00:19:59.740
I hated you.

00:19:59.740 --> 00:20:02.200
I couldn't do anything about it.

00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:06.580
But you needed me.

00:20:06.580 --> 00:20:12.170
It didn't matter to me who you were,
as long as you needed me!

00:20:12.170 --> 00:20:17.090
I just wanted to be worth
something again. That was all.

00:20:17.090 --> 00:20:19.090
I stopped caring about everything.

00:20:19.090 --> 00:20:23.340
I took advantage of your good
will to do all kinds of awful things.

00:20:23.340 --> 00:20:25.300
But... I'm sorry.

00:20:25.300 --> 00:20:29.680
Only as I'm about to say
goodbye to you do I realize...

00:20:29.680 --> 00:20:35.360
...my wish came true a long time ago.

00:20:35.360 --> 00:20:39.320
All the people we met,
all the things we've done...

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:42.400
I'm satisfied with them all
from the bottom of my heart.

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:46.530
So I have to pay you all back somehow.

00:20:46.530 --> 00:20:51.200
Whether that's buying you
even a second of time,

00:20:51.200 --> 00:20:54.580
or saving only a single one of you...

00:20:54.580 --> 00:20:57.540
This is my last wish.

00:20:57.540 --> 00:21:01.420
Now I no longer owe this world anything.

00:21:01.420 --> 00:21:07.600
But when I think about how ugly you'll
look when you find me and start crying...

00:21:08.760 --> 00:21:12.980
I've always had a crybaby
for a commander, haven't I?

00:21:12.980 --> 00:21:17.190
Really... How many times
have you slowed me down?

00:21:23.110 --> 00:21:27.450
I really do hate you!

00:21:32.250 --> 00:21:37.210
Sorry, but this is goodbye, M4.

00:21:37.210 --> 00:21:39.880
Whether you're sad or angry...

00:21:39.880 --> 00:21:44.090
Whether you remember me or forget me...

00:21:44.090 --> 00:21:48.970
I hope this memory gives you
power and makes you stronger!

00:21:52.850 --> 00:21:58.150
Goodbye, my friend.

00:22:12.700 --> 00:22:14.620
AR15...

00:22:26.550 --> 00:22:29.550
This is M16 with AR Team.

00:22:29.550 --> 00:22:33.100
We've all left the combat area.

00:22:33.100 --> 00:22:36.600
Only one casualty.

00:22:38.020 --> 00:22:40.150
Roger.

00:22:40.150 --> 00:22:43.610
This mission will be completed
upon your return.

00:24:12.820 --> 00:24:16.330
Is your plan going well?

00:24:16.330 --> 00:24:20.000
Yes. I've implanted the Parapluie system

00:24:20.000 --> 00:24:25.000
in another Griffin doll, to serve
as a replacement for AR15.

00:24:25.000 --> 00:24:28.630
I've succeeded in transferring the
interference module as well.

00:24:28.630 --> 00:24:34.430
I suggest waiting until the
next operation to activate it.

00:24:34.430 --> 00:24:35.720
Okay.

00:24:35.720 --> 00:24:39.310
This time, I'll wait a little.

00:24:39.310 --> 00:24:43.810
I really will... until the
day I meet M4A1.
